__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.env
*.log
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/

# ── Generated evidence — deliberately NOT tracked ────────────────────────────
# CI writes these at run time and uploads them as workflow artifacts; they are
# reproduced by the documented commands, not reviewed as source.
#
# Why they are ignored: committing per-run output meant every pair of branches
# from the same base conflicted. On 17 Oct 2026 PRs #1/#2 collided on
# artifacts/pytest.xml and artifacts/test-output.txt (add/add) and the merge had
# to be resolved by hand. Regenerate instead of committing:
#   python -m pytest -p offline_guard tests -q --junitxml=artifacts/pytest.xml
#   python run_evals.py --mode mock --report artifacts/mock-report.md
artifacts/*
!artifacts/README.md

# Written to the repository root by .github/workflows/offline-baseline.yml
offline-results.xml

# Default output paths of run_evals.py (report + matching JSON payload)
EVAL_REPORT*.md
EVAL_REPORT*.json
